4AAF9"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Coloris", "keywords": ["handtracking", "mixedreality", "puzzle", "relaxing", "puzzlegame"], "long_description": "Coloris transforms your room into a peaceful mixed\u2011reality puzzle space where your hands do all the work. \u270b\ud83c\udf08\nPut your controllers aside and dive into a relaxing world of color\u2011matching challenges designed around smooth, intuitive hand\u2011tracking interactions. Solve gradients, align hues, and snap pieces into place with gestures that feel natural, precise, and deeply satisfying.\nBuilt for comfort and clarity, Coloris blends seamlessly into your environment, creating a cozy MR experience that\u2019s perfect for unwinding, focusing, or taking a creative break. Every puzzle is handcrafted to feel calming yet rewarding, offering a gentle flow state that players of all ages can enjoy.\n\u2728 Features\n\u2022 \tHand\u2011Tracking Only -> Play entirely with your hands. No controllers needed.\n\u2022 \tMixed Reality Gameplay -> Puzzles appear naturally in your real space.\n\u2022 \tRelaxing Color Challenges -> Match hues, gradients, and patterns in a soothing flow.\n\u2022 \tTactile Interactions -> Grab, rotate, and snap pieces with responsive precision.\n\u2022 \tCozy & Accessible -> Easy to learn, calming to play, and welcoming for everyone.\n\u2022 \tReplayable & Creative -> Each puzzle feels fresh, inviting experimentation and exploration.\nWhether you're a puzzle fan, a hand\u2011tracking enthusiast, or someone looking for a calm MR experience, Coloris offers a warm, tactile escape that fits beautifully into your everyday space. \ud83c\udfa8", "short_description": "Coloris is a cozy mixed\u2011reality puzzle game built for hand tracking. \u270b\ud83c\udf08\nSet your controllers down and solve relaxing color\u2011matching challenges that appear right in your room. Snap pieces into place, complete gradients, and enjoy intuitive, gesture\u2011based interactions that feel natural and satisfying. Perfect for quick sessions, creative breaks, and anyone who loves calm, tactile MR gameplay. \ud83c\udfa8\u2728"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://latencyvoidvr.wixsite.com/latency-void/english-privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Latency Void", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://latencyvoidvr.wixsite.com/latency-void", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25663226179954192"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 3, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "945121595056384"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1597025238114111"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1253539126734445"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1253539126734445"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1779123600, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "945121595056384"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "26067191669557639", "version": "1.0.3"}, "id": "1971895903735095", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "25663226159954194", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"